msgstr "Bloccata"

#: ../ViewModels/StartSessionViewModel.cs:360
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Manually choosing clothes will reduce your bonus to {0:F0}% of the base "
"multiplier and lock the outfit for good: there is no changing your mind or "
"going back. Proceed?"
msgstr ""
"Scegliere manualmente i capi ridurrà il vostro bonus al {0:F0}% del "
"moltiplicatore base e bloccherà l'outfit in via definitiva: non sarà "
"possibile ripensarci né tornare indietro. Procedere?"

#: ../Views/Controls/DashboardPermissionsPanel.axaml:151
msgid "May I be excused?"
msgstr "Con permesso..."

#: ../Views/WritingLinesPunishmentView.axaml:99
