msgid ""
"The corner awaits. Feet together, hands behind your back, facing the wall. Do "
"not dawdle."
msgstr ""
"L'angolo vi attende. Piedi uniti, mani dietro la schiena e rivolta al muro. "
"Non indugiate."

#: ../Models/Banks/CornertimeInstructionBank.cs:16
msgid ""
"The corner, please. Legs apart, hands behind your neck, and your face to the "
"wall."
msgstr ""
"All'angolo, prego. Gambe divaricate, mani dietro la nuca e faccia al muro."

#: ../ViewModels/WritingLinesPunishmentViewModel.cs:19
msgid "The ink dries whether you write or not."
msgstr "L'inchiostro si secca, che scriviate o meno."

